layout: null
permalink: /feed.json
---
{%- comment -%}
  THE BLOG AS A FEED, in the standard JSON Feed 1.1 format (jsonfeed.org).

  The Aristotle launcher's News column reads it, through the engine's Worker
  (one request at launch, the "news" section). Feed readers can read it too.
  Every post is in it. Writing the post is the whole publishing step.

  The picture is the post's own `image:` front matter when it has one, else
  the one the homepage's "Latest" row uses (_data/home.yml, thumbnails). A post
  with neither has no picture, and the launcher shows the mark instead.
  Engine side: modules/ai/docs/design/home_tab.md, section 3.
{%- endcomment -%}
{
  "version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1",
  "title": {{ site.title | jsonify }},
  "home_page_url": {{ "/" | absolute_url | jsonify }},
  "feed_url": {{ "/feed.json" | absolute_url | jsonify }},
  "items": [
    {%- for post in site.posts limit: 20 %}
    {%- assign image = post.image | default: site.data.home.thumbnails[post.url] %}
    {
      "id": {{ post.url | absolute_url | jsonify }},
      "url": {{ post.url | absolute_url | jsonify }},
      "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
      "summary": {{ post.excerpt | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | truncatewords: 40 | jsonify }},
      {%- if image %}
      "image": {{ image | absolute_url | jsonify }},
      {%- endif %}
      "date_published": {{ post.date | date_to_xmlschema | jsonify }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
